===== English =====

1. Free Non-Commercial, Academic, Educational & Evaluation Use.
   Individuals, universities, research institutions, non-profit organizations,
   and engineering teams may use, copy, modify, and run RSIAgent free of charge
   for personal learning, academic or scientific research, teaching,
   benchmarking, and internal non-commercial technical evaluation.

2. Open-Source Forking & Non-Commercial Sharing Permitted.
   You may fork this repository, publish academic reproduction artifacts, and
   share non-commercial modifications or patches with the community, provided
   that the original copyright notice and this license text are retained in all
   copies or substantial portions of the project.

3. Commercial Production & Revenue-Generating Use.
   Deploying RSIAgent in commercial production operations, offering it as a
   paid or managed cloud/SaaS service, or embedding/distributing it as part of
   a commercial product or revenue-generating service requires prior written
   authorization from Acosmi.
   Contact: fushihua@acosmi.com — https://acosmi.com

4. Third-Party Material.
   Licenses and notices for third-party material apply to the corresponding
   material and remain in effect. This notice does not replace those notices or
   change the rights granted by those third-party licenses.

===== 中文 =====

1. 个人、学术研究、教学与非商业评估免费。
   个人开发者、高校、科研院所、非营利机构及工程团队，均可出于个人学习、学术与科学研究、教学演示、基准评测及内部非商业技术评估目的，免费使用、复制、修改和运行 RSIAgent。

2. 允许开源 Fork、学术复现与非商业分享。
   只要在副本或重要部分中完整保留原始版权声明与本许可文本，您可以自由 Fork 本仓库、发布学术复现代码，或在非商业前提下向社区分享修改与补丁。

3. 商业化生产与创收使用需授权。
   将 RSIAgent 用于商业化生产运营、作为付费或托管云服务（SaaS/PaaS）对外提供，或将其集成、打包、分发至商业产品或创收服务中，需事先获得 Acosmi 的书面授权。
   联系方式：fushihua@acosmi.com — https://acosmi.com

4. 第三方材料。
   第三方材料的许可与声明仍适用于其对应材料；本声明不替代这些声明，也不改变相应第三方许可授予的权利。
